  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Zimbabwe. The main target groups are women and girls living with HIV/AIDS. Through trainings, mobilizing, campaigns, networking and materials production, the project aims to achieve that more of the women living with HIV and AIDS in the targeted communities are demanding and accessing health services to a greater extent.</narrative>
